  "claims": [
    "An exhaustive eight-form dependent view of every actual primitive in the registered unified MAC/structural/cartesian catalogue.",
    "Dependent classifiers of every actual competitor at seven specified source shapes; atomic MAC boxes admit no step. Original typed wires, tails and changes remain data in the returned views.",
    "Sequential and tensor fusion roots each have exactly the five declared competitor forms: same fusion, old left/right edit, or cartesian left/right edit.",
    "Both fusion-root resolvers accept every actual competitor from the exact whole-source fusion diagram and produce a common target and a higher comparison from existing local squares.",
    "Each residual has type ShortForward: identity or one actual forward Step. A forward Path can be extracted, so no inverse execution/rewrite is hidden in the residual.",
    "Generated comparisons have empty root support and at most two higher constructors. When both changes lift through the same placement, support is exactly the surrounding Placement.needs and the bound remains two.",
    "Stateful correlated-joint endpoint repair is available in an updated checked model, preserving arbitrary correlated past, original shared state and input.",
    "The concrete added-left-unit-inverse example yields residual counts 1 and 1, comparison count 2 and zero guards."
  ],
  "classified_root_forms": [
